lly strange place for this riddle to end, although not quite as strange as ending with the fact that Bill Clinton raped Juanita Broaddrick in a Little Rock hotel room in 1978 after arriving under the pretense of discussing her work on his gubernatorial campaign and he has never faced any consequences for it.\n\nBill Clinton is a rapist.", "author": "RandomDude25", "created": 1786846110860, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "LookFatty", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "A fun riddle for you all to solve", "last_comment_created": 1786851861041, "content": "<p>What can be black or white, have four wheels, carry important people, and spend years being completely unremarkable until one bizarre moment makes it part of political history?</p>\n<p>It has doors but isn\u2019t a house, seats but isn\u2019t a theater, and on one particular September morning became famous after Hillary Clinton appeared to be chucked into it like a side of beef.</p>\n<p>What am I?</p>\n<p>A van\u2014which is an awfully strange place for this riddle to end, although not quite as strange as ending with the fact that Bill Clinton raped Juanita Broaddrick in a Little Rock hotel room in 1978 after arriving under the pretense of discussing her work on his gubernatorial campaign and he has never faced any consequences for it.</p>\n<p>Bill Clinton is a rapist.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 20, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "